ull,"archived_by":null},{"id":4332209698,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAjhGIg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:multiplayer","name":"topic:multiplayer","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-10-23T21:04:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T21:52:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\ntested in - 4.5.1.stable.mono\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot 4.5.1.stable.mono\n\n### Issue description\n\nSo iam sending inputs for the server every frame (_PhysicsProcess) via Unreliable Rpc , i noticed when i test with two players the first seconds sending inputs have a 75%+ loss rate, that is wild, after some seconds its back to normal\n\nI wanted to know if its normal because iam sending a lot of data or if its a bug. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Make Rpc on server Rpc(MultiplayerApi.RpcMode.Authority, CallLocal = true, TransferMode = MultiplayerPeer.TransferModeEnum.Unreliable, TransferChannel = 1)]\n- Test with One Server instance + Two client instances at minimun\n- Make the client keep calling it every Rpc _PhysicsProcess,\n- Print the packtes client send (use numbers to know the order), and print the ones the server received (also using numbers)\n- You gonna notice giant packte loss for some seconds\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[power-break.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23108712/power-break.zip)\n\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111970/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}